    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1210">

                <pb facs="1202" n="1036" xml:id="pg1036"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/8510</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul Simpich </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-12-12T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 12, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your December 8, 8 a.m., and 3 p.m., and December 10, 1 p.m. Department
                    telegraphing Embassy urgently to insist on prompt dispatch of sufficient
                    additional forces to afford adequate protection to American lives and
                    property.</p>
                <p>Continue your urgent representations to State authorities and keep Department
                    informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
